{
  "key": 19247,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I am sorry.\r",
        "Clair, our Gym Leader, entered\n",
        "the Dragon’s Den behind the Gym.\r",
        "I have no idea when our Leader\n",
        "will return."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Clair, our Gym Leader, is waiting\n",
        "for you.\r",
        "However, it would be impossible for\n",
        "a run-of-the-mill Trainer to win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "You defeated Clair?\n",
        "That’s amazing!\r",
        "I’ve never heard of her losing to\n",
        "anyone other than Lance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "No. Only chosen Trainers may train\n",
        "here. Please leave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "If Clair allows it, her grandfather--\n",
        "our Master--will also.\r",
        "You may enter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "My radio’s busted?\n",
        "Lately, I only get this weird signal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Arooo! Voices in my head!\r",
        "Huh? I’m listening to my radio!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you going to make your Pokémon\n",
        "forget some moves?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Those Trainers called Dragon Tamers\n",
        "are all from Blackthorn City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow, you came through the Ice Path?\r",
        "You must be a real hotshot Trainer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Blackthorn City\n",
        "A Quiet Mountain Retreat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Blackthorn City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Clair\f",
        "The Blessed User of Dragon Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Move Deleter and Move Tutor House\r",
        "A Mysterious House Where You Can Make\n",
        "Pokémon Forget and Remember Moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00013",
      "en_US": "Dragon’s Den Ahead"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0629_T30_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Wild Pokémon will appear regularly\n",
        "if you don’t run, but walk quietly in the\f",
        "tall grass.\r",
        "If your party Pokémon are\n",
        "tired, it is better to avoid running,\f",
        "and go straight to a Pokémon Center."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
